id: weapon-master
name: Weapon Master
talentCategory: weapon
prerequisites: 2+ Weapon Talents
description: >
  Your Weapon Attacks are able to conduct your ki, dealing more damage when you land them successfully.
text: >
  Weapon Master: Your Weapon Attacks are able to conduct your ki, dealing more damage when you land them successfully.
  –Prerequisites: 2+ Weapon Talents
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase the Dice Category of your Energy Charges by 1 Category for your Armed Attacks.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round, 3/Encounter]: If you deal Damage to an Opponent with an Armed Attack, you may use the Basic Attack Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. If you do, that Attacking Maneuver must be an Armed Attack.

---

[passive]
# (1) An Armed Attack's Energy Charges a Dice Category up (chat.mjs postAttack).
charges.armedCategory += 1;
# (2) Damage dealt to an Opponent by an Armed Attack: the Basic Attack out of sequence, offered on its card - itself an Armed
# Attack; once a Round, three times an Encounter, counted when taken (chat.mjs offerWeaponMaster; grants.weaponMaster).
allow weaponMaster.strike;
